WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Facility365 explained in 2 minutes.

00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
The dashboard immediately shows what matters today.

00:13.000 --> 00:24.000
Report damage: describe it briefly, choose the location and add a photo.

00:24.000 --> 00:33.000
Turn the damage report into an order with one tap.

00:33.000 --> 00:52.000
